/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (The Applications page is the main landing page in Zoho Creator that appears after users sign in. It displays all available applications as individual cards, making it easy to identify, access, and manage projects. Each application card provides key information such as the application name, creation date, and quick action options like Edit, Open, and More.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (The page also features a Create Application button, allowing users to develop new applications from scratch or by using pre-built templates. Additional tools, including a search bar and application filters, help users quickly locate specific applications, particularly in environments with numerous projects. This centralized workspace streamlines application management and improves productivity by providing convenient access to all application development resources.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
